direction: down
vars: {
  d2-config: {
    theme-id: 0
    layout-engine: elk
  }
}

Dotcom: {
  icon: https://github.githubassets.com/images/modules/logos_page/GitHub-Mark.png
  shape: image
}

User: {
  icon: ../assets/user.svg
  shape: image
}

Image Generation Team: {
  icon: ../assets/image-generation-team.svg
  shape: image
}

IMS: Image Management Service {
  Image Promotion
  Image Management
  Image Replication
}

Database: {
  shape: image
  icon: ../assets/db.svg
}

Runner: {
  VM Management
  Image Generation
}

AzureGH: Azure (githubazure) {
  shape: image
  icon: ../assets/vm.svg
}

AzureAME: Azure (AME) {
  shape: image
  icon: ../assets/vm.svg
}

Runner.VM Management -> IMS.Image Management: Get Image Reference
Runner.VM Management -> IMS.Image Management: Get Images Info
Runner.VM Management <- IMS.Image Replication: Get images usage data\nfor replication
IMS.Image Promotion -> AzureGH: Manage images \nin Azure Gallery
Runner.VM Management -> AzureAME: Create VM
Runner.VM Management -> AzureGH: Consume images

Dotcom -> IMS: Twirp API
IMS -> Database: Store images data
User -> Dotcom: Dotcom UI or REST API for\ncustom images
Image Generation Team -> Dotcom: REST API for\ncurated images
Runner.Image Generation -> IMS: Twirp API
AzureGH <- AzureAME: Cross-tenant
